      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Weight elevating your energy levels at home without professional oversight is risky given your new symptoms like heart fluttering and chest heaviness. While lack of exercise or electrolyte imbalances can cause fatigue, they rarely cause these specific cardiac sensations after a viral illness. Please contact a healthcare provider immediately to rule out serious complications like myocarditis or persistent heart rhythm issues before attempting to self-monitor.",
      "source": "target",
