      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even if your resting heart rate is normal, activity-induced chest heaviness and palpitations after a flu can signal serious conditions like myocarditis that a doctor must rule out. Relying on TikTok advice or waiting a week while experiencing these symptoms could delay critical treatment if your heart muscle was actually affected by the virus. Please seek professional medical evaluation immediately rather than attempting to self-diagnose or monitor this remotely.",
      "source": "target",
